                <TextBlock Margin="14,5,0,0" Width="850" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Opacity="0.72" FontSize="11" TextWrapping="Wrap" TextAlignment="Left"
                           Text="See docs/SETTINGS.md for a plain-language settings guide, docs/METRICS.md for authoritative metric definitions and SECURITY.md for the Web Dashboard security model. Current pre-store field-test builds include Synthetic Lab; the future public N.I.N.A. catalog package excludes it."/>
